The key insight:
- f(s) = Σ A_i where A_i is indicator that prefix of length i equals suffix of length i
- E[f(s)²] = E[(Σ A_i)²] = Σ E[A_i] + 2 Σ_{i<j} E[A_i × A_j]
- E[A_i] = k^(-(n-i)) for 1 ≤ i < n
- E[A_i × A_j] = k^(-gcd(i,j)) for 1 ≤ i < j < n

